testcase "simplification - remove duplicate rule"
 
   All user variables and function definitions have been cleared.
                                                                   Type: Void
x := groupPresentation([1,2,3],[[1,2,3],[1,2,3]])
 

   (2)  <a b c |  a*b*c,  a*b*c>
